Article, original documentation, and generated certificate/audit result data:
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International; full terms in CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Third-party numerical records in data/catalogue/ and their copies embedded
in source/certificate metadata are attributed excerpts from the Hristov et al.
catalogues. No new license is granted over those original records; their
original terms apply. This package redistributes only the numerical records
needed for the stated comparisons, not third-party papers or entire catalogues.
See SOURCES.md. Mathematical transformations and newly generated results are
distinct from the original catalogue material.

Arb/FLINT, python-flint, MPFR/GMP, and CAPD are external dependencies; their
libraries and third-party header implementations are not vendored here and
retain their own licenses. In particular, the Apache grant for project code
does not relicense any dependency included by a C++ #include directive.
